                "description": "Canaropa FP412-1355, 5/16 Inch Modern Stainless Steel Flush Pull -- Measuring 5-5/16 inches high and 2-3/16 inches wide, the Modern Stainless Steel Pocket Door Handle is available in both satin stainless steel and polished stainless steel. It has just enough of a lip inside for even large hands to get a firm grip without spoiling the sleek look of this modern pocket door pull. The 5-5/16 Inch Modern Stainless Steel Flush Pull is made in Europe by JNF--who is world renowned for their modern stainless steel door hardware.",
